:"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Text spoken in this segment, when the provider reports it."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"turnindex","children":[{"type":"text","value":"turnIndex?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional turnIndex?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2675","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2675"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Index into the request's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"turns"},{"type":"text","value":", when the provider reports it."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"voice","children":[{"type":"text","value":"voice?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional voice?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2677","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2677"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Voice heard in this segment, when the provider reports it."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"endseconds","text":"endSeconds","level":3},{"id":"startseconds","text":"startSeconds","level":3},{"id":"text","text":"text?","level":3},{"id":"turnindex","text":"turnIndex?","level":3},{"id":"voice","text":"voice?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2669](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2669)\n\nA stretch of audio attributable to one turn (multi-voice) or one utterance\n(single voice). This is what tells a consumer which turn is where.\n\n## Properties\n\n### endSeconds\n\n```ts\nendSeconds: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2673](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2673)\n\nEnd of the segment in seconds.\n\n***\n\n### startSeconds\n\n```ts\nstartSeconds: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2671](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2671)\n\nStart of the segment in seconds.\n\n***\n\n### text?\n\n```ts\noptional text?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2679](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2679)\n\nText spoken in this segment, when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### turnIndex?\n\n```ts\noptional turnIndex?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2675](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2675)\n\nIndex into the request's `turns`, when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### voice?\n\n```ts\noptional voice?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2677](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2677)\n\nVoice heard in this segment, when the provider reports it.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TTSSegment\ntitle: TTSSegment\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2669](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2669)\n\nA stretch of audio attributable to one turn (multi-voice) or one utterance\n(single voice). This is what tells a consumer which turn is where.\n\n## Properties\n\n### endSeconds\n\n```ts\nendSeconds: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2673](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2673)\n\nEnd of the segment in seconds.\n\n***\n\n### startSeconds\n\n```ts\nstartSeconds: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2671](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2671)\n\nStart of the segment in seconds.\n\n***\n\n### text?\n\n```ts\noptional text?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2679](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2679)\n\nText spoken in this segment, when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### turnIndex?\n\n```ts\noptional turnIndex?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2675](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2675)\n\nIndex into the request's `turns`, when the provider reports it.\n\n***\n\n### voice?\n\n```ts\noptional voice?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2677](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2677)\n\nVoice heard in this segment, when the provider reports it.\n"}
